 the network allow list is managed by policy."),unix_sockets:C(o()).describe("Unix socket paths allowed (allowUnixSockets), as enforced: while managed settings mandate the sandbox, from managed, --settings and user settings only."),allow_all_unix_sockets:O().describe("Whether every Unix socket is allowed (allowAllUnixSockets, as enforced), so socket blocking is off and a missing socket-filter dependency costs nothing; the terminal shows its socket warning only when this is false."),ignored_glob_patterns:C(o()).describe("Patterns the Linux sandbox ignores (globs it does not support).")}).describe("The restrictions configured in the sandbox settings (the settings' filesystem, network and socket lists, not the runtime's built-in defaults), as the settings files merge them; the grant fields (fs_allow_read, fs_allow_write, unix_sockets, allow_all_unix_sockets) as enforced.")}).describe("@internal The session's /sandbox dialog state, for a host on the same machine (the sandbox governs the commands Claude runs there).")),Zo=f(()=>u({subtype:T("get_binary_version")}).describe("Requests the responder's CLI binary version. Used by /version in --remote mode so the thin client can show both its own and the remote container's version.")),SY=f(()=>u({version:o(),buildTime:o().optional()})),TY=f(()=>u({id:B(pKr).optional().describe("Which row this is. Stable where the English name is not: match a particular row on this. Absent from a CLI that predates it. A later CLI may add values: treat an unknown value as absent."),name:o(),tokens:E().int(),color:o(),isDeferred:O().optional(),kind:B(snr).describe("What the row is, the same classification the /context result's context_usage rows carry: 'used' content occupies the window; 'free' is the remaining window; 'buffer' is the compaction reserve; 'deferred' rows are out-of-window tool schemas. Classify on this, never on the English name.")})),wY=f(()=>u({color:o(),isFilled:O(),categoryName:o(),tokens:E().int(),percentage:E(),squareFullne