- If this is an existing file, you MUST use the ${qe} tool first to read the file's contents. This tool will fail if you did not read the file first.`}function o9s(e,n){if(IO({model:e,leanPrompt:n}))return`Writes a file to the local filesystem, overwriting if one exists.

