${pn}`;return`${mt}${Bn}${on}

- ${Ge||We?"The agent's final report is not shown to the user \u2014 relay what matters.":"The agent's final message is returned to you as the tool result; it is not shown to the user \u2014 relay what matters."}
- ${h?`Use ${In} with the agent's ID or name to continue a previously spawned agent with its context intact; a new ${ht} call starts fresh`:Vt}${fn}.
- Each agent type's model, reasoning effort, and tools come from its definition (\`.claude/agents/*.md\` frontmatter or SDK \`agents\`).${Se}
