  --hook-timeout <sec>        SIGTERM the hook after <sec> seconds (default: ${Oe/1000}).
  --expected-spawn-seconds <n>  p99 boot time for runners this orchestrator spawns
                              (default: ${He}). Sent on every Poll as the
